\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {16}{\ignorespaces Dual-stage pipelines on the two-class ($98$-image) test set ($67$ benign, $31$ malignant). (a)~single-run ladder (one seed each; indicative only). (b)~rigorous evaluation with out-of-fold training masks, five-seed ensembling and a bootstrap $95\%$ CI. (c)~the individual seeds behind~(b). ``GT-ROI'' is the perfect-segmentation upper bound (the same Stage-2 fed ground-truth-mask crops); ``Gap'' is GT-ROI F1 minus pipeline F1, i.e.\ how much score is still lost to imperfect segmentation. ``Malig.\,R'' is malignant recall.}}{23}{table.caption.39}\protected@file@percent }
